a local event.\n\n**Accessibility:**\n- Ensure that participants understand that the challenge is about consistency over intensity. It's okay to have days with fewer steps; the goal is to average 10,000 steps a day over the month.\n- Provide resources for beginners on how to increase their daily steps safely.\n\n**Sustainability:**\n- Encourage participants to continue their new habits beyond the challenge, setting new goals and challenges for themselves.\n- Use the momentum to start a new challenge or series of challenges to maintain the community's engagement and support for the cause.\n\nThis challenge not only promotes physical activity but also raises awareness and funds for an important global issue, all while fostering a supportive and motivated community.": 2.21875,
